    "note": "repo HEAD MOVED during the run (58c30f3 -> 7ab30b6), which is exactly what the snapshot pin protects against. All 188 .py files under the snapshot verified byte-identical to `git archive 58c30f3 cartridges examples` after the runs; `diff -r` showed only runtime __pycache__ dirs extra. Every job log printed CARTRIDGES_IMPORT_PATH=/tmp/amsnap_mqb/cartridges (probe run from /tmp)."
  },
